{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/hawaiinautical/items/213714/", "pk": 213714, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/hawaiinautical/", "pk": 30, "shortname": "hawaiinautical", "name": "Hawaii Nautical - Oahu", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Waikiki Signature Sunset Sail", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": true, "color": 9, "unicode": "Waikiki Signature Sunset Sail", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 6.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 5.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 850, "description": "#There’s nothing like a Hawaiian sunset, and nothing beats seeing a sunset sail at sea!\n\n##Schedule\nWinter\n- 5:00pm-6:30pm Daily (Except Fridays)\n\nSummer\n- 5:30pm-7:00pm Daily (Except Fridays)\n\n##Rates\n**Adult:**  ***$99***\n**Child:**  ***$65***\n**Infant:**  ***Free!***\n\n###Need a ride?\n**Adult with Waikiki Shuttle Pick-Up:**  ***$122.62***\n**Child with Waikiki Shuttle Pick-Up:**  ***$85.66***\n**Infant with Waikiki Shuttle Pick-Up:**  ***Free!***\n\n#Book Online and Save More!\n\n\n\n##About\nThere’s nothing like a Hawaiian sunset, and nothing beats seeing a sunset sail at sea. Enjoy a scenic cocktail cruise, one of the best things to do in Waikiki. Sail south toward Diamond Head, pausing on the way back to catch the moment the sun slips below the horizon – you may even see the green flash. The vessel is a stable sailing catamaran boat. \n\nMENU:\nLight bento box included. Complimentary tropical cocktails, beer, wine, juice, soda, and water.\n\n\n##Departure - Near Waikiki\nKewalo Basin Harbor\n1125 Ala Moana Blvd\nHonolulu, HI 96814\n\nOptional Shuttle available from select Waikiki pick up location and at an additional fee.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "#Aloha!\n#IMPORTANT REQUIRED STEP:  Separately you will receive an email for the waiver to be done by each individual in your party participating in a Hawaii Nautical/Port Waikiki Cruises activity. Parents/guardians also submit a form for each person 17 and under. Answer all questions, review health and safety precautions, and sign the waiver acknowledgment within one day of your scheduled activity.\n\nWear easy to remove footwear for the barefoot vessel.  For safety, no spray sunscreen may be used on board.\n\n\n##Transportation\n\nConvenient self-parking is also available at the harbor and nearby beach park.\n\nThank you for your reservation with Hawaii Nautical. We look forward to having you with us!\n\nMahalo!\n\nHawaii Nautical \nPH: 808-234-7245", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "##Check in at the vessel \"HONU LANI\" along the front row of slips at the \"HAWAII NAUTICAL\" yellow sign at **Slip F28** no later than 20 minutes prior to departure.\n\nConvenient self-parking is available at the harbor and nearby beach park.\n\nIf self-driving, some GPS units locate better using \"1079 Ala Moana Boulevard, Honolulu, HI 96814\"\n\n![Description of image](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/ZF1mUatGRPyzF0cHBKPs)", "no_transportation_minutes": 20, "headline": "Starting at $99! • Year Round • Daily • 5:30PM • 1.5 Hrs • Drinks & Appetizers Included!", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{